@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy & storage"; }
<article class="shell policy-page"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE TRANSPARENCY</p><h1>Privacy &amp; storage.</h1><p>Your shopping bag is stored in your browser’s localStorage under <code>forme.cart.v1</code>. It contains product identifiers and quantities, and remains on this device until you empty your bag or clear your browser’s site data.</p><p>No account, payment details or authentication are required. The catalog uses hardcoded product data; checkout and order processing are not available.</p><p>Product images are hosted locally. Image source and license information is included in the project’s image credits file.</p><a class="text-link" asp-action="Cart">Manage your bag ↗</a></article>